    The networks: PaddlePaddle's own PyTorch implementation of PP-OCRv6.

The published weights are PaddlePaddle's model.safetensors files from the
PaddlePaddle organisation on the Hugging Face Hub, each stated on its model
card as Apache-2.0. Zhang et al., "PP-OCRv6: From 1.5M to 34.5M Parameters,
Surpassing Billion-Scale VLMs on OCR Tasks", arXiv:2606.13108.

